  "2026-11-06T04:31:40.445Z",codex-sol,"Read issue in full. Current main already uses boundedText to preserve surrogate pairs, with boundary and SDK tests from PR 92. Extend every boundary offset through the real no-git SDK tracker and record a behavioral revert of the existing protection instead of replacing working truncation."
  "2026-11-06T04:39:30.667Z",codex-sol,"Expanded boundary offsets -2, -1, 0 and +1 for item/triage projection and real no-git SDK tracker decisions. Replacing only boundedText with UTF-16 slice in a disposable copy fails all 7 Unicode tests; the restored implementation passes 7/7. Existing strict malformed-surrogate refusals remain covered."
  "2026-11-06T04:47:05.024Z",codex-sol,"The installed-model end-to-end acceptance uses this public defect item from a verified main snapshot. Five packed CLI reference spellings preserve the same projected evidence, fit admission at 1182 prompt tokens, and return identical native Noul probabilities without changing durable tracker state."
  "2026-11-06T05:08:24.046Z",codex-sol,"Final-code validation retains 7/7 Unicode regressions, including real SDK no-git decisions at every boundary offset. The raw slice behavioral revert fails 7/7, and all restored protections pass 13/13. Final packed public-item inference repeats the same token parity and immutable durable tracker snapshot for five native reference spellings."
  "2026-11-06T05:22:53.961Z",codex-sol,"Final local npm and Bun-command release gates each passed 454/454 with all four c8 coverage dimensions at 100%. Unicode boundary and malformed-source controls remain green, and the behavioral UTF-16 slice revert fails 7/7. Final-head PR CI remains the next gate; releasing the claim without closing the item."
